  "$amberForDescription": "The protanopia variant (design 3.4 and 4.3). Each red step maps to an amber step, and no amber text token is brighter than its mode's text ceiling (NS-18). From red.200 up the amber step has the nearest luminance; the amber ramp has fewer dark steps, so the surface tiers keep their order instead (each under 1.2%) and red.100 shares amber.050 with red.050. Steps the amber ramp lacks: red.300 takes amber.400, red.500 and red.600 take amber.600, red.1000 takes amber.950. amber.700 and amber.800 are one red unit under #784300 and #864B00, which sat just over the Night and Dusk ceilings.",
